or status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>MATSUBARA HIROSHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>WALKER TOBY</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MATSUBARA, HIROSHI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>WALKER, TOBY</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A video/audio processing device (10) divides a segment to subsegments to be the candidates of r segments at step S1, sorts the subsegments into groups of subsegments similar to one another at step S2, selects groups to be objects of signature from the sorted groups at step S3, selects one r segment from each selected groups at step S4, and calculates the weights of each selected r segment at step S5.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>Un dispositif (10) de traitement vidéo/audio divise un segment en sous-segments destinés à constituer les candidats de segments r à l'étape S1, il trie les sous-segments en groupes de sous-segments similaires les uns aux autres à l'étape S2, il sélectionne des groupes destinés à être des objets de signature dans les groupes triés à l'étape S3, il sélectionne un segment r dans chacun des groupes sélectionnés à l'étape S4 et il calcule les poids de chaque segment r sélectionné à l'étape S5.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://w